{"id":"ca1cc46ea16ab569","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-reed-muller-distance.md","title":"Reed–Muller 码的距离下界","display":"thm-reed-muller-distance — Reed–Muller 码的距离下界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-reed-muller-distance","aliases":["28-thm-reed-muller-distance"],"display":"thm-reed-muller-distance — Reed–Muller 码的距离下界","depends_on":["[[28-df-reed-muller-code]]"],"source_book_location":"§19.2.4 following Definition 19.12","source_printed_pages":"383","source_pdf_pages":"409","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-reed-muller-distance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-reed-muller-distance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-reed-muller-distance — Reed–Muller 码的距离下界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9d41937b5cf52c18\" href=\"?note=9d41937b5cf52c18\" title=\"28-df-reed-muller-code\">28-df-reed-muller-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§19.2.4 following Definition 19.12"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"383"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"409"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F,\\ell,d,I_{\\ell,d},P_a,\\operatorname{RM}\">\\(\\mathbb F,\\ell,d,I_{\\ell,d},P_a,\\operatorname{RM}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9d41937b5cf52c18\" href=\"?note=9d41937b5cf52c18\" title=\"28-df-reed-muller-code\">28-df-reed-muller-code</a> 的签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb F^{I_{\\ell,d}}\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb F^{I_{\\ell,d}}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\">\\(\\mathbb F\\)</span> 上不同形式多项式以系数区别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\ne b\\Longrightarrow |\\{x\\in\\mathbb F^\\ell:P_a(x)\\ne P_b(x)\\}|\\ge\\left(1-\\frac d{|\\mathbb F|}\\right)|\\mathbb F|^\\ell.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\ne b\\Longrightarrow |\\{x\\in\\mathbb F^\\ell:P_a(x)\\ne P_b(x)\\}|\\ge\\left(1-\\frac d{|\\mathbb F|}\\right)|\\mathbb F|^\\ell.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：P_a−P_b 非零且总次数不超过 d。按变量个数归纳的根数界给出至多 d|F|^(ℓ−1) 个零点：取最后变量最高非零次数 k，首项系数次数至多 d−k；首项系数非零的纤维至多 k 根，其余纤维至多 |F| 根，合并得到界。故差异点数至少所述数。d&lt;|F| 还保证单射。已核对原书距离陈述，并给出本地论证。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§19.2.4 following Definition 19.12；印刷页 383；PDF 页 409。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-reed-muller-code","status":"resolved","id":"9d41937b5cf52c18","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-reed-muller-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-reed-muller-code","status":"resolved","id":"9d41937b5cf52c18","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb F,\\ell,d,I_{\\ell,d},P_a,\\operatorname{RM}$ 采用 [[28-df-reed-muller-code]] 的签名；$a,b\\in\\mathbb F^{I_{\\ell,d}}$。$\\mathbb F$ 上不同形式多项式以系数区别。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb F,\\ell,d,I_{\\ell,d},P_a,\\operatorname{RM}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb F^{I_{\\ell,d}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"a\\ne b\\Longrightarrow |\\{x\\in\\mathbb F^\\ell:P_a(x)\\ne P_b(x)\\}|\\ge\\left(1-\\frac d{|\\mathbb F|}\\right)|\\mathbb F|^\\ell.","display":true}],"bytes":1590,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-373","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-reed-muller-code]]、[[28-thm-reed-muller-distance]]、[[28-df-list-decodable-code]]、[[28-df-local-decoder]]、[[28-thm-berlekamp-welch-decoding]]、[[28-lem-hardcore-distribution]]、[[28-df-local-list-decoder]]。"}],"outgoing":["9d41937b5cf52c18"]}